abstract: >-
  A real-time offer recommendation system built on contextual Bayesian Thompson
  Sampling, with SQL feature pipelines, a FastAPI service, offline policy
  evaluation and backtesting, scenario simulations, automated retraining,
  monitoring, and AWS deployment.
